      "category": "passive",
      "placement": "bot",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The members of the brigade wildly swing their weapons—primarily spears—in a frenzied attack at each enemy adjacent to the troop (DC 29 basic Reflex save). The damage depends on the number of actions. 1 1d12+1 piercing damage 2 2d12+11 piercing damage 3 3d12+11 piercing damage"
